<title>SWEDEN: Sweden's Riksbank leaves repo at flat 4.10 pct.</title>
<headline>Sweden's Riksbank leaves repo at flat 4.10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, set a one week repurchase agreement at an unchanged 4.10 percent on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Riksbank last cut the repo rate on December 17.</p>
<p>The Riksbank's deposit rate is currently set at 3.75 percent and the lending rate at 5.25 percent.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
